<span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur-sm px-2 py-1 rounded-full font-label-caps text-label-caps text-on-surface uppercase">Living</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-title-editorial text-title-editorial text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Home Decorating</h3>
