</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm text-on-surface-variant font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase tracking-wider mb-space-xs">
<span class="text-secondary font-bold">Kitchen</span><span>·</span><span>10 min read</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface group-hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-space-xs">
