</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant mb-space-md">Small apartment pantry organization doesn't need a remodel. 21 renter-friendly ideas — door racks, shelf risers, decanting systems — that double what fits in a tiny pantry.</p>
