<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">01</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant">vertical_align_top</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-title-editorial text-title-editorial text-on-surface mb-space-sm font-semibold">Ascend Vertically</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant">
              Use vertical wall space — floating picture ledges and brass peg rails double your functional surface area without claiming a single inch of floor plate.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md flex items-center gap-space-xs text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase">
