<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant">grid_view</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-title-editorial text-title-editorial text-on-surface mb-space-sm font-semibold">Zone Everyday Rituals</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant">
              Group everyday essentials into zones — keep coffee rituals, cooking oils, and daily skincare clustered together in shallow trays to contain micro-clutter.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-space-md mt-space-md flex items-center gap-space-xs text-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase">
<span>Spatial Rule #2</span>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Tip 03 -->
<div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-space-md">
<span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary font-bold">03</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant">sync_alt</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-title-editorial text-title-editorial text-on-surface mb-space-sm font-semibold">Demand Double Duty</h3>
<p class="font-body-regular text-body-regular text-on-surface-variant">
